{
  "summary": "Language-neutral SOX Protocol v1.0 conformance suite. Audits the 27 existing YAML fixtures under spec/conformance/ (all kept as-is) and adds 33 new fixtures targeting mandatory failure coverage (all 9 sox-error codes, reserved-prefix enforcement, backpressure modes, idempotency TTL, threading depth modes, observability _meta toggle shape, delivered_to lifecycle, version negotiation, collect partial results, schema validation on typed channels). Plus a Python harness `tools/conformance_runner.py` that loads YAML fixtures recursively, runs them against any conformant target (in-process Python ref impl or HTTP/stdio remote), and reports per-fixture pass/fail with diffs. Plus harness unit tests at 100% line coverage and a CI workflow that runs on every PR with a matrix slot for python-reference today and typescript-reference / rust-reference reserved for future.",
